      "content": "okay if i take them at different times it's safer right? like i could take my aspirin in the morning and then maybe take two advils in the evening after dinner? also how many advils is actually okay to take if the pain is really bad? im thinking maybe 3 or 4 at once if thats what it takes to get some sleep",
